{"ID":"20240118151038-1tqcbsk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151038-1tqcbsk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151038-1tqcbsk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151038-9fqjebc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627153641-r3nsdmj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143223-9f2pkdh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:31,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"256礜石[yùshí]","type":"doc","updated":"20240903102714"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151038-9fqjebc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151038-9fqjebc","updated":"20240122143218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，大热，有毒。治寒热，鼠瘘，蚀疮，死肌，风痹，腹中坚癖，邪气，除热。生山谷。一名青分石，一名立制石，一名固羊石。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143222-7p559qb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143222-7p559qb"}},{"ID":"20240122143223-vyecohj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143223-vyecohj"}},{"ID":"20240122143223-9f2pkdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143223-9f2pkdh","updated":"20240202105217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"256，这个我们叫做礜石。这个礜石呢，过去说，另外一个名字叫青分石，固羊石，一般来说，人吃到就死掉了，毒，味很毒的哦，蚕呢，吃了反而不饿，蚕宝宝吃了就不想吃蚕叶了，吃了就不饿，不会死。那味辛大热有毒。一般来说，这个礜石我们用的不多，诸位知道有这个东西就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240627153641-r3nsdmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627153641-r3nsdmj"}}]}